  title: Road to Arborium
  requiredClassId: 
  requiredLevel: 1
  version: 1
  offer: Trimery's direct timber road is broken. Travel north through Briarback, follow the western ridge trail, then turn south into Arborium's Northern Gate. Deliver our road report to the Guild Registrar outside the Adventurers' Guild. The Chieftain is an optional hunt, not a requirement for this journey.
  activeDialogue: Go north through Briarback, west along the ridge and south into Arborium. Speak to the Guild Registrar by the fortified guildhall beside the Northern Gate.
  locationHint: "Trimery north \u2192 Briarback west \u2192 Arborium Northern Gate \u2192 Guild Registrar."
